        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "For the last 2–3 months, patient reports increasing difficulty preparing meals, becoming confused with recipes and appliances, and forgetting pots on the stove. She reports leaving the gas on twice and describes this as scary."
